# 📄 END-TO-END TECHNICAL AUDIT REPORT
## Employee Agent & Admin Dashboard Connection Lifecycle

---

###  Executive Summary

This document provides a complete, end-to-end technical audit of how an **Admin Dashboard** and an **Employee Agent** connect, pair, communicate, and transmit system logs in the **ITR Monitoring System**.

The architecture uses a **decoupled cloud relay model** powered by **Supabase Cloud (PostgreSQL + Auth + Realtime WebSockets)**, combined with a hybrid **Node.js + Go Native Binary Agent** running on the employee laptop.

